---
// Lead-magnet opt-in page, offer-stack style: centered single column, headline,
// form up top, deliverable as a concrete checklist, practitioner block, form again.
// Copy edits flow through the editable artifact DH works in; keep section shapes stable.
import LPBase from '../layouts/LPBase.astro';

const title = 'Balloon Side Hustle Starter Guide (Free) | Balloonia Events';
const description =
  'Free guide from a working balloon studio: the $150 starter kit, your first three builds, real pricing, and how to land your first $500 client with no ad budget.';
---

<LPBase title={title} description={description} canonical="https://balloonia.events/side-hustle-guide" ogImage="/images/categories/arches-garlands.webp">
  <main class="magnet">
    <p class="magnet-brand">Balloonia Events</p>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="magnet-hero">
      <div class="magnet-col">
        <p class="magnet-eyebrow">Free starter guide</p>
        <h1>Start a balloon side hustle that actually pays</h1>
        <p class="magnet-sub">
          Most balloon side hustles do not fail because the garlands are bad. They fail because the
          pricing is. This guide is the numbers half nobody posts: what the builds cost, what they
          sell for, and how the first paying client happens.
        </p>

        <form class="magnet-form" data-guide-form>
          <label class="sr-only" for="email-hero">Email address</label>
          <input id="email-hero" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your email" required autocomplete="email" />
          <input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" class="hp" aria-hidden="true" />
          <button type="submit">Send me the free guide</button>
        </form>
        <p class="magnet-micro">Instant access, delivered to your inbox too. No spam, unsubscribe anytime.</p>
        <p class="magnet-error" data-form-error hidden>That did not go through. Try again, or email contact@balloonia.events and we will send it by hand.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The stack -->
    <section class="magnet-stack">
      <div class="magnet-col">
        <h2>What is inside</h2>
        <ul class="stack-list">
          <li>
            <span class="stack-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>The honest math</strong>
              <p>What a $300 garland costs in materials and hours, and the pricing trap that kills most side hustles in year one.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="stack-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>The $150 starter kit, itemized</strong>
              <p>Seven items, $115 to $160 all in. The one tool that is non-negotiable and the two purchases beginners waste money on.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="stack-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Your first three builds, in order</strong>
              <p>Garland, then arch, then backdrop, and the sizing traps that make beginner work look beginner.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="stack-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Pricing from day one</strong>
              <p>The three things that move every quote, the never-go-below floor, and how to say a number without apologizing for it.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="stack-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>The first paying client, $0 ad budget</strong>
              <p>The free Google listing that shows up above websites, the photographer trade, and the community build chosen coldly.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="stack-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>When it becomes a business</strong>
              <p>The pipeline every booking runs through and what to systematize first.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Practitioner block -->
    <section class="magnet-who">
      <div class="magnet-col">
        <h2>Who is behind this</h2>
        <p>
          Balloonia Events is a custom balloon studio in London, Canada. Brenda, our lead artist,
          is a formally trained artist and builds everything from $50 bouquets to $5,000 corporate
          installations. We publish our prices on a public storefront, and the numbers in this
          guide are the numbers we run the studio on.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="magnet-faq">
      <div class="magnet-col">
        <h2>Quick questions</h2>
        <details>
          <summary>How much can I realistically make?</summary>
          <p>At our studio a standard garland sells for $200 to $500 and carries $40 to $60 in materials, with three to four hours of real time all in. Your market sets your numbers, the guide teaches you how to find them and hold them.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How much time does this take next to a job?</summary>
          <p>It starts as one build at a time, mostly weekends. The kit takes an evening to learn, a booked garland takes a Saturday morning. You control the volume by how much you take on.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Is it free?</summary>
          <p>Yes. You give an email, you get the guide instantly, and occasionally we send a build tip or pricing lesson. Unsubscribe whenever.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Do I need any experience?</summary>
          <p>No. The guide assumes you have never inflated anything more ambitious than a birthday balloon. It starts at the shopping list.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Does this work outside Canada?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Prices are in CAD and your market will set its own numbers, but the kit, the builds, the pricing logic, and the free channels work anywhere people throw events.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <section class="magnet-final">
      <div class="magnet-col">
        <h2>Get the guide</h2>
        <p>Ten minutes of reading, one $150 shopping list, and your first build this weekend.</p>
        <form class="magnet-form" data-guide-form>
          <label class="sr-only" for="email-final">Email address</label>
          <input id="email-final" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your email" required autocomplete="email" />
          <input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" class="hp" aria-hidden="true" />
          <button type="submit">Send me the free guide</button>
        </form>
        <p class="magnet-micro">Instant access. No spam, unsubscribe anytime.</p>
        <p class="magnet-error" data-form-error hidden>That did not go through. Try again, or email contact@balloonia.events and we will send it by hand.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="magnet-footer">
      <p>Balloonia Events · London, Canada · <a href="https://balloonia.events">balloonia.events</a></p>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    const forms = document.querySelectorAll('[data-guide-form]');
    forms.forEach((form, i) => {
      form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
        e.preventDefault();
        const f = e.currentTarget as HTMLFormElement;
        const errEl = f.parentElement?.querySelector('[data-form-error]');
        const btn = f.querySelector('button');
        const email = (f.querySelector('input[name="email"]') as HTMLInputElement).value;
        const website = (f.querySelector('input[name="website"]') as HTMLInputElement).value;
        errEl?.setAttribute('hidden', '');
        if (btn) {
          btn.disabled = true;
          btn.textContent = 'Sending…';
        }
        try {
          const res = await fetch('/api/guide', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
            body: JSON.stringify({ email, website, source: i === 0 ? 'side-hustle-lp-hero' : 'side-hustle-lp-final' }),
          });
          if (!res.ok) throw new Error('bad status');
          window.location.href = '/side-hustle-guide/thanks';
        } catch {
          errEl?.removeAttribute('hidden');
          if (btn) {
            btn.disabled = false;
            btn.textContent = 'Send me the free guide';
          }
        }
      });
    });
  </script>

  <style>
    .magnet {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      color: #191817;
      background: #ffffff;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    .magnet-col {
      max-width: 40rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 1.25rem;
    }
    .sr-only {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
    }
    .hp {
      position: absolute;
      left: -9999px;
      height: 1px;
      width: 1px;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .magnet-brand {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #8a877f;
      padding: 1.75rem 0 0;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .magnet-hero {
      padding: 2.5rem 0 3rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .magnet-eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #1c3d34;
      background: #eef4f0;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
      margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    }
    .magnet h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 6vw, 3.3rem);
      line-height: 1.08;
      margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }
    .magnet-sub {
      font-size: 1.12rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: #4b4a45;
      margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
      max-width: 34rem;
    }

    .magnet-form {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      justify-content: center;
      max-width: 30rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .magnet-form input[type='email'] {
      flex: 1 1 15rem;
      padding: 0.95rem 1.1rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border: 1.5px solid #d9d2c5;
      border-radius: 0.65rem;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .magnet-form input[type='email']:focus {
      outline: 2px solid #1c3d34;
      border-color: #1c3d34;
    }
    .magnet-form button {
      padding: 0.95rem 1.6rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      background: #1c3d34;
      border-radius: 0.65rem;
      transition: background 0.15s ease;
    }
    .magnet-form button:hover {
      background: #142c26;
    }
    .magnet-form button:disabled {
      opacity: 0.7;
      cursor: wait;
    }
    .magnet-micro {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #8a877f;
      margin: 0.7rem 0 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .magnet-error {
      color: #a33;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .magnet h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.5vw, 1.8rem);
      margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .magnet-stack {
      padding: 2.75rem 0;
      background: #faf7f2;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee7da;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee7da;
    }
    .stack-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.1rem;
    }
    .stack-list li {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.9rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #eee7da;
      border-radius: 0.8rem;
      padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    }
    .stack-check {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      width: 1.5rem;
      height: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #1c3d34;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 0.1rem;
    }
    .stack-list strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
    }
    .stack-list p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #4b4a45;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .magnet-who {
      padding: 2.75rem 0;
    }
    .magnet-who p {
      color: #4b4a45;
      line-height: 1.65;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 36rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .magnet-faq {
      padding: 0 0 2.75rem;
    }
    .magnet-faq details {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5ddcf;
      padding: 0.9rem 0;
    }
    .magnet-faq summary {
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .magnet-faq p {
      color: #4b4a45;
      margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .magnet-final {
      padding: 3rem 0 3.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      background: #faf7f2;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee7da;
    }
    .magnet-final > .magnet-col > p:not(.magnet-micro):not(.magnet-error) {
      color: #4b4a45;
      margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    }

    .magnet-footer {
      padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #8a877f;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5ddcf;
    }
    .magnet-footer p {
      margin: 0;
    }
    .magnet-footer a {
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }
  </style>
</LPBase>
